    "letting go of anger through compassion"
   ],
   "skos:broader": {
    "@id": "wg:cognitive-reappraisal"
   },
   "skos:definition": "A short reflective exercise for someone who has wronged you: you keep the wrong in view but deliberately see the offender as a whole, flawed human being who needs to change, and try to wish them well, instead of replaying the hurt.",
   "skos:inScheme": {
    "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/scheme/compassion-and-relationships"
   },
